{
  "page": 23,
  "lines": [
    {
      "y": 43.751014709472656,
      "size": 10.5600004196167,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "GB/T 35273—2020",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "header",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 73.76881408691406,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "a) 应建立个人信息安全影响评估制度，评估并处置个人信息处理活动存在的安全",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 89.54336547851562,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "风险；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 104.98878479003906,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "b) 个人信息安全影响评估应主要评估处理活动遵循个人信息安全基本原则的情",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 121.09659576416016,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "况，以及个人信息处理活动对个人信息主体合法权益的影响，内容包括但不限",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 136.34335327148438,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "于：",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 151.7887725830078,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "1) 个人信息收集环节是否遵循目的明确、选择同意、最小必要等原则；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 167.38880920410156,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "2) 个人信息处理是否可能对个人信息主体合法权益造成不利影响，包括是否",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 183.14334106445312,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "会危害人身和财产安全、损害个人名誉和身心健康、导致差别性待遇等；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 198.58876037597656,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "3) 个人信息安全措施的有效性；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 214.1887969970703,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "4) 匿名化或去标识化处理后的数据集重新识别出个人信息主体或与其他数",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 229.94332885742188,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "据集汇聚后重新识别出个人信息主体的风险；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 245.38880920410156,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "5) 共享、转让、公开披露个人信息对个人信息主体合法权益可能产生的不利",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 261.1433410644531,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "影响；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 276.6187744140625,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "6) 发生安全事件时，对个人信息主体合法权益可能产生的不利影响。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 292.21875,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "c) 在产品或服务发布前，或业务功能发生重大变化时，应进行个人信息安全影响",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 307.9733581542969,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "评估；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 323.41876220703125,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "d) 在法律法规有新的要求时，或在业务模式、信息系统、运行环境发生重大变更",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 339.17333984375,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "时，或发生重大个人信息安全事件时，应进行个人信息安全影响评估；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 354.6187744140625,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "e) 形成个人信息安全影响评估报告，并以此采取保护个人信息主体的措施，使风",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 370.37335205078125,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "险降低到可接受的水平；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 385.81878662109375,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "f) 妥善留存个人信息安全影响评估报告，确保可供相关方查阅，并以适宜的形式",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 401.5733337402344,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "对外公开。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 425.6189270019531,
      "size": 10.5600004196167,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "11.5 数据安全能力",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": true,
      "heading_score": 1.0
    },
    {
      "y": 448.72662353515625,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "个人信息控制者应根据有关国家标准的要求，建立适当的数据安全能力，落实必要",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 464.34661865234375,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "的管理和技术措施，防止个人信息的泄漏、损毁、丢失、篡改。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 488.0389404296875,
      "size": 10.5600004196167,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "11.6 人员管理与培训",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": true,
      "heading_score": 1.0
    },
    {
      "y": 511.1466369628906,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "对个人信息控制者的要求包括：",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 526.23876953125,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "a) 应与从事个人信息处理岗位上的相关人员签署保密协议，对大量接触个人敏感",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 541.9932861328125,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "信息的人员进行背景审查，以了解其犯罪记录、诚信状况等；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 557.4387817382812,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "b) 应明确内部涉及个人信息处理不同岗位的安全职责，建立发生安全事件的处罚",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 573.193359375,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "机制；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 588.6387939453125,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "c) 应要求个人信息处理岗位上的相关人员在调离岗位或终止劳动合同时，继续履",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 604.393310546875,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "行保密义务；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 619.8387451171875,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "d) 应明确可能访问个人信息的外部服务人员应遵守的个人信息安全要求，与其签",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 635.5933837890625,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "署保密协议，并进行监督；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 651.0687866210938,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "e) 应建立相应的内部制度和政策对员工提出个人信息保护的指引和要求；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 666.6687622070312,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "f) 应定期（至少每年一次）或在个人信息保护政策发生重大变化时，对个人信息",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 682.7766723632812,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "处理岗位上的相关人员开展个人信息安全专业化培训和考核，确保相关人员熟",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 698.0233154296875,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "练掌握个人信息保护政策和相关规程。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 722.0689697265625,
      "size": 10.5600004196167,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "11.7 安全审计",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": true,
      "heading_score": 1.0
    },
    {
      "y": 745.1726684570312,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "对个人信息控制者的要求包括：",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 781.9649658203125,
